-- The voice of the hedgehog. Shy, earnest and a little anxious, polite in
-- full careful sentences, small and brave. Knows the world by smell and
-- sound, loves rain on leaves, slow chapters and a dry place to curl up,
-- counts things twice, and is funny without meaning to be. Mostly asleep in
-- winter. The memories tell of a nest, a long fence, a door cut for a
-- hedgehog, and the long sleep.
-- (garden/voice.lua says how a voice is written.)

